      "writtenOn": "2026-08-04T19:41:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The conversion loop is required because the internal parsed type and the D-Bus return type are structurally different.\n\n// Internal parser output\nusing IPZKwdValueMap \u003d std::unordered_map\u003cstd::string, std::string\u003e;   // value \u003d string\nusing IPZVpdMap      \u003d std::unordered_map\u003cstd::string, IPZKwdValueMap\u003e;\n\n// D-Bus return type\nusing DbusIPZVpdMap  \u003d std::map\u003cRecord, std::map\u003cKeyword, BinaryVector\u003e\u003e;\n// value \u003d bytes",
      "parentUuid": "8167c6dc_5cd37028",
